  THIS IS A SAMPLE HELP FILE. IT CAN BE CUSTOMIZED IN ANY WAY THE USER
DESIRES.  

----------------LIST OF VALID COMMANDS---------------------------------------
COMMAND           ALTERNATE FORM  	OPERANDS
-------           --------------        ------J-8 GOTO 1500,1510,1520,1530,1540,1460,1460,1460,1460,1460,1560
1393 ON J-19 GOTO 1570,1580,1590,1600,1610,1620,1460,1630,1460,1460,1460
1394 ON J-30 GOTO 1640,1460
1395 GOTO 1460
1400 IF VAL(O$(0,3))<1 THEN T$="They's lumpy ole leather saddlebags.":RE----
ABORT					NONE
ALTEST					NONE
CONNECT   	  CONN			CONNECTION ID,RESPONSE ID
CONSOLE		  C			FILE NAME
DEQUEUE		  DEQ			REC OR PUN
DIAGNOSE	  D			NONE OR FILE NAME OR {LST}
DIRECTORY	  DIR			NONE OR DRIVE ID
DISCONNECT	  DISC			NONE
ERASE		  E